{"id":"alrededor","lemma":"alrededor","pos":"adv","rank":528,"glosses":["around (from place to place)"],"ipa":"/alredeˈdoɾ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-alrededor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quiero viajar alrededor del mundo.","en":"I want to travel around the world.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589795","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to travel, journey"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"world, earth"}]},{"text":"No había nadie alrededor.","en":"There was no one about.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707002","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"no one"},null]},{"text":"Me gusta que no haya nadie alrededor.","en":"I like that there's no one around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422552","words":[null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"beech, beech tree"},{"g":"no one"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"Ella miró alrededor.","en":"She looked around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444326","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to look at","l":"mirar"},null]},{"text":"Nuestra escuela tiene alrededor de mil estudiantes.","en":"Our school has about one thousand students.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608666","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"thousand"},{"g":"student","l":"estudiante"}]}]}